  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tiko program: Preventing hunger and malnutrition</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We have developed a program &apos;steps out of poverty&apos; - in use for more than 5 years. The goal is to teach villagers proven methods to take certain steps. Following as many steps as possible contributes to prevent hunger and malnutrition - this can be done in a family or in a group like the &apos;women&apos;s clubs&apos;. We want to fund the activities in form of seminars including: permaculture, agriforestry, livestock, organic fertilizer, agriprotein etc. There will be sub projects following.</narrative>
  </description>
